'''Techneurosis''' (オーバーテクノロジー ''Ōbātekunorojī'', Lit. "'''Over Technology'''") is the third event in the series of [[:Category:Cyclone Stages#Advanced Cyclone Stages|Advanced Cyclone Stages]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update]]. It appears on the '''13th''' and '''14th''' of every month.

